# Normalise line endings in the repository to LF, whatever the checkout looks
# like locally. Without this, every file touched on Windows comes back as a
# whole-file modification, and a diff of four hundred changed lines that turn
# out to be carriage returns is a diff nobody reads. A release gate that people
# have learnt to skim is not a gate.
* text=auto eol=lf

# The synthetic corpus is the one data format the repository carries, and it is
# text by intent, so that a reader can inspect it in a diff.
*.csv text eol=lf
